{#-
  What the plan panel says after a person answers it.

  afpsql renders this, in afpsql's words, from what it actually recorded — not
  from what the page that was pressed claimed to be. A person who was shown a
  mislabelled control reads the truth here.
-#}
{% extends "layout.html.j2" %}
{% block panel %}
<p class="decided">{{ document.message }}</p>
<p class="hint">You can close this window.</p>
{% endblock %}
